      </section>

      <section data-sec="" id="honest" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px 48px;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--vy-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--vy-ink);">What was harder than expected</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.76; color: var(--vy-muted);">Owner onboarding. Giving thirty-one people a portal means thirty-one people discovering questions they had never bothered to ask, and the first month generated more owner contact than usual rather than less. It settled by the second statement, but it was not the quiet week anyone had planned for.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.76; color: var(--vy-muted);">Two owners also wanted their historic PDFs to look exactly as before. They don't; the new statement has more detail and a different shape. Both preferred the new one within a month, but neither said so at the time.</p>
